
Welcome to the LPI Essentials practice terminal.

This is a real Linux kernel with BusyBox tools, running in your browser. You're logged in as "student". The root password is "root": use "su -" or "sudo COMMAND" for admin tasks.

Practice files for the exam questions are in your home directory. Start with "cat README".

BusyBox versions of some commands differ slightly from the GNU versions; "COMMAND --help" shows what a command supports. Nothing here reaches the network, and everything resets when you reload the page.

